id: pm-memory-forward-guard-timeout
title: Investigate portable create guard timeout under coverage load
description: A quick coverage run for pm-memory-recall-freshness failed test/policy-size-boundary.test.ts at import. The SDK reported extension_mutation_guard_timed_out for pm-memory-forward-base before create. The SDK guard has a five-second deadline. The same real-tracker test passed in isolation with and without V8 coverage. Measure guard costs for a valid 1 MiB policy body under concurrent coverage load and preserve native revision certification. The separate file watchdog expiry is test lifecycle evidence for pm-memory-higm.
